+    /**
+     * Sable: physical keys type the PIN whichever child has focus. Upstream they only reach this
+     * view through the password field's key listener, so once the trackpad or Tab moved focus to
+     * an on-screen digit, keyboard digits went nowhere and Enter pressed that digit.
